# Deny everything, then name what the image needs.
#
# An allowlist rather than a list of exclusions, and deliberately: the working
# tree weighs 874 MB against 4.5 MB of payload, and a directory added to the
# repository later cannot slip into the build context by being forgotten here.
*

!pyproject.toml
!src
!web

# Re-excluded inside what was just let back in.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc

# The neutral table, whose corrections are the identity. app.py refuses it at
# boot, so shipping it could only ever fail late; it has no reason to travel.
src/weather_simulator/calibration/data/cloud_correction_placeholder.json
